description.mekanism.emergency_rescue_unit=When the player is dying, they consume a unit to regenerate health
description.mekanism.advanced_interception_system_unit=The upgraded version of the emergency rescue unit will not be consumed
description.mekanism.seal_unit=Seal up the MekaSuit armor to move through space
description.mekanism.oxygen_supply_unit=Adds an oxygen tank to the MekaSuit helmet and continuously consumes oxygen while enabled
description.mekanism.thermal_protection_unit=Allows the MekaSuit to be caused in space without overheating
description.mekanism.insulated_unit=Directs electricity to the ground to prevent injury
description.mekanism.bee_control_unit=Emit special pheromones that make bees blind to you
description.mekanism.warp_clear_base_unit=A special method is used to remove the temporary warp value from the body
description.mekanism.warp_clear_advanced_unit=A special method removes normal distortion values from the body
