description.mekanism.magic_optimization_unit=Use special methods to reduce the use of vis
description.mekanism.goggles_of_revealing_unit=Same as Goggles of Revealing
description.mekanism.intelligent_temperature_regulation_unit=Keep your body at the optimal temperature at all times
description.mekanism.automatic_liquid_supply_unit=The water contained in the atmosphere automatically replenishes the body's required water
description.mekanism.gravitational_modulating_additional_unit=Require 'Gravitational Modulating Unit', Provides additional features
description.mekanism.energy_shield_unit=Use energy shields to block damage
description.mekanism.chaos_resistance_unit=Resists the Chaos Generational Resistance
description.mekanism.chaos_vortex_stabilization_unit=If there is a chaotic vortex nearby, the unit is automatically consumed to quell the vortex
description.mekanism.smart_shielding_unit=Through chip analysis, it automatically blocks the other party's gaze
description.mekanism.infinite_energy_supply_unit=Keep MekaSuit full of energy at all times
description.mekanism.infinite_interception_and_rescue_system_unit=Exhausted of the resources of the infinite dimension, this unit was finally born, and when this unit is installed, you will not get hurt
description.mekanism.band_of_aura_unit=Mana can be slowly created at a rate of 1 mana/tick and stored in items that can carry mana
description.mekanism.basic_band_of_aura_unit=Mana can be slowly created at a rate of 3 mana/tick and stored in items that can carry mana
description.mekanism.advanced_band_of_aura_unit=Mana can be slowly created at a rate of 5 mana/tick and stored in items that can carry mana
description.mekanism.elite_band_of_aura_unit=Mana can be slowly created at a rate of 7 mana/tick and stored in items that can carry mana
description.mekanism.ultimate_band_of_aura_unit=Mana can be slowly created at a rate of 9 mana/tick and stored in items that can carry mana
description.mekanism.creative_band_of_aura_unit=Mana can be slowly created at a rate of §6§k2147483647§r§7 mana/tick and stored in items that can carry mana
description.mekanism.smart_wireless_unit=Once this unit is installed, content within the AE network can be accessed
description.mekanism.infinite_gas_supply_unit=Keep MekaSuit full of gas at all times
description.mekanism.automatic_attack_unit=Automatically attack all creatures within the range of the player.
description.mekanism.counterattack_unit=Returns magic counterattack damage to the true attacker based on installed units.
description.mekanism.power_enhancement_unit=Increases the user's attack speed and damage
description.mekanism.high_speed_cooling_unit=Speed up the use of cooling items.
description.mekanism.quantum_reconstruction_unit=By dismantling and reconstructing matter at the quantum level, the tunneling effect allows it to penetrate blocks like a spectator mode.
description.mekanism.hp_boots_unit=Increases the maximum maximum health of the user
description.mekanism.optical_camouflage_unit=Enables optical camouflage for installed armor slots, and fully hides the wearer when the full suit is active
description.mekanism.entity_display_box_unit=Displays screen-space boxes around living entities within range
description.mekanism.wall_cling_unit=Allows climbing or slow sliding while touching walls
description.mekanism.ore_visual_enhancement_unit=Scans server-side for nearby ore dictionary entries starting with ore, then renders boxes and distance labels client-side
description.mekanism.automatic_ore_mining_unit=Automatically mines nearby ore dictionary blocks using the helmet ore visual scanner's range and delay
description.mekanism.looting_amplification_unit=Increases the effective looting level when killing entities with the Meka-Tool
description.mekanism.knockback_control_unit=Increases Meka-Tool attack knockback strength
description.mekanism.execution_unit=Executes heavily wounded targets when attacking with the Meka-Tool
description.mekanism.automatic_extinguish_unit=Automatically extinguishes fire by consuming MekaSuit energy
description.mekanism.smelting_unit=Smelts block drops harvested by the Meka-Tool and disables Silk Touch while active
description.mekanism.impact_wave_unit=Creates a transparent impact wave on hard landings, damaging nearby entities
